      <div class="article__main">
        <div class="article__body prose">
          <blockquote>
<ul>
<li><strong>Quick answer:</strong> GTA 6 launches on <strong>PS5 and Xbox Series X|S only</strong>, on <strong>19 Nov 2026</strong>. It is <strong>not</strong> on PS4. <strong>No PC date or version is announced.</strong></li>
<li><strong>Xbox One owners can stream it</strong> with Xbox Cloud Gaming from <strong>1 AM ET on 19 Nov</strong>, at Xbox Series S graphics settings.</li>
<li><strong>30 FPS target</strong> on every console. <strong>PS5 Pro adds PSSR (sharper picture) and ray-traced shadows.</strong></li>
</ul>
</blockquote>
<p><strong>Words used on this page.</strong> <em>Native</em> means the game runs on your own console. <em>Cloud gaming</em> means the game runs far away and is streamed to you. <em>FPS</em> means frames per second.</p>
<h2 id="platform-table" tabindex="-1">Platform table</h2>
